"""Tasks written before the edge-case step was measured, and scored only once.

They live outside TASKS on purpose. Adding them there would change the validator
hash that the dataset and the recorded adapter runs are tied to, and these tasks
must never reach training.

Hidden tests check only what each prompt states, and every prompt states
something the visible test does not reach. That gap is what the step has to find.
"""
from __future__ import annotations

